00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:12.630
When they're gathered together like this,

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:16.490
you get a sense of that amazing muskox group defense.

00:24:16.490 --> 00:24:20.170
Their horns facing out and the calves will be on the inside,

00:24:20.170 --> 00:24:23.280
being protected by that whole protective circle.

00:24:23.280 --> 00:24:26.220
That way, any wolves coming to get at those calves,

00:24:26.220 --> 00:24:30.000
